Description: Change Korean desktop name from 지에디트 to 텍스트 편집기
 The transliteration "지에디트" is uncommon and confusing for Korean users.
 Change the displayed application name to the descriptive "텍스트 편집기".
 intltool-merge generates Name[ko] from ko.po automatically.
Author: jongkyung.woo <jkwoo@gooroom.kr>

Index: gedit.git/po/ko.po
===================================================================
